    "text": "Buffalo\nBattle between city and Sylvia’s House continues with lawsuit, condemnation notice\n57 minutes ago\nBUFFALO, N.Y. — The occupants at Sylvia’s House on Bailey Avenue are hoping they can get a little more time in their home after the latest notice from the City of Buffalo. The city placed a notice of condemnation on the homeless shelter’s door on Wednesday, saying it has “illegally occupied the structure as a homeless shelter without health, fire and safety requirements.”",
